OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FParamedics speed in 71-year-old
OL,7,     FEnid, who's struggling to breathe.
OL,8,     FIn Paediatrics, three-year-old
OL,9,     FRory is rushed in with a rare
OL,10,     Fcondition: a conker stuck up his
OL,11,     Fnose.
OL,12,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FNighshift staff deal with
OL,14,     Fdrunkenness in the cubicles, the
OL,15,     Fvictim of a dog attack who might
OL,16,     Fhave a tooth in the wound, and a
OL,17,     Fpatient brought into resus via
OL,18,     Fambulance in a diabetic coma.
