OL,5,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,6,     FIn a Silicon Valley home invasion,
OL,7,     Fmillionaire Raveesh Kumra is
OL,8,     Fmurdered. No forced entry leads
OL,9,     Finvestigators to suspect an inside
OL,10,     Fjob.
OL,11,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,12,     FAfter a woman disappears, an
OL,13,     Finvestigation identifies the
OL,14,     Flikely culprit to be her
OL,15,     Fboyfriend, but despite years of
OL,16,     Feffort he receives only a light
OL,17,     Fsentence.
